From 2e8131788b47a8fcb2d9033640d28ed221a4a62d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AppRestore <apprestore@localhost>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 18:18:17 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(keychain): read the keychain passphrase from the
 environment or stdin

--keychain-passphrase puts the passphrase on the command line, where
other local users can read it with ps. The passphrase can now also come
from IPATOOL_KEYCHAIN_PASSPHRASE or, with --keychain-passphrase-stdin,
from the first line of stdin (read once, only when the keyring needs
it, without consuming later input). Priority: flag, environment, stdin.
Without any of them the behaviour is unchanged.
